# spell-levels and skills: Flora's schedule (the first four as Lucia's, Water Bind 16, Divine Rain 20,
# Binding Rain 28, Miracle Tears 32) and no stat buffs. Jian and Flora (party_flora), first temple
# battle; Jian Fights, then Flora's Special list is opened with her level index (0x020B4778) pinned to
# each level in turn: 13 (Healing Water, Tender Rain, Cure Squall), 16 (and Water Bind), 20 (and Divine
# Rain), 28 (and Binding Rain: six entries), 32 (and Miracle Tears: seven, a second page), 40 (the same
# seven). Shots fl_lv13 to fl_lv40, with _page2 where there is one; fl_wb and fl_br show the two new
# entries' names, costs, and descriptions at level 28. Run with --save.
include party_flora
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 12
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv13
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv13
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 15
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv16
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv16
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 19
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv20
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv20
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 27
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv28
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv28
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot fl_wb
press Down 8
wait 50
shot fl_br
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 31
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv32
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv32
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot fl_lv32_page2
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 39
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot fl_lv40
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_fl_lv40
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot fl_lv40_page2
press B 8
